nd out what's going on behind the curtains.<br>It will take you about 120 minutes to get all the 3 endings as well as some dead ends.<br>By the way, I'm pretty sure it is a HEALING game.<br><br>P.S. You may consider the Sealtail Studio as another name of LR Studio, if you like.",
